WEBVTT

00:10.160 --> 00:11.537
Paladin Corps.

00:12.204 --> 00:14.723
The biggest
religious organization in the world,

00:14.915 --> 00:17.501
under the Global Holy Church.

00:17.918 --> 00:21.797
A magical army that protects world peace.

00:23.465 --> 00:29.721
Their army solves large-scale
violent crimes involving magic.

00:30.556 --> 00:35.686
And they're the only army that is
able to deal with witch incidents.

00:37.437 --> 00:41.166
However, the Paladin Corps,
who protect world peace,

00:41.166 --> 00:45.796
has a dark side that
the public will never see.

00:46.446 --> 00:47.573
That is...

02:48.485 --> 02:51.238
Ashaf, come on. Take it out.

02:51.488 --> 02:54.491
Come on, don't rush.
Your food will get cold.

02:55.492 --> 02:56.968
The weather is nice.

02:57.411 --> 02:59.554
It might have been nice to eat outside.

03:00.706 --> 03:02.958
Hurry up and take it out.

03:04.084 --> 03:07.796
My, my. How impatient. Great.

03:16.722 --> 03:18.557
You wanna die?

03:18.849 --> 03:21.226
It's still not
the time to kill me yet, right?

03:21.810 --> 03:22.894
Hear me out, now.

03:23.687 --> 03:25.480
The envelope says

03:25.480 --> 03:31.069
There's a witch incident with
several brutal murders by a witch.

03:31.486 --> 03:35.048
This time, looks like
it's more difficult than usual.

03:35.257 --> 03:36.274
Huh?

03:36.575 --> 03:39.202
If it's a witch incident
on the third continent,

03:39.619 --> 03:41.805
they'll certainly be deployed.

03:42.748 --> 03:44.666
It certainly will make things difficult.

03:45.208 --> 03:48.712
In this mission,
once we make contact with the witch,

03:48.896 --> 03:52.299
the Paladin Corps are
sure to get in our way.

03:56.928 --> 03:59.890
Which means,
it's a race to take the witch.

04:02.051 --> 04:07.606
(The Witch and the Demon Sword - Prologue)

04:09.274 --> 04:10.400
The tower is...

04:10.734 --> 04:12.861
The whole town might
end up in tatters at this rate!

04:13.195 --> 04:14.780
There's a witch on the loose.

04:15.906 --> 04:17.716
What's with this crowd?

04:18.033 --> 04:19.284
They're evacuating.

04:19.701 --> 04:22.036
It's just a witch. This much is overkill.

04:22.412 --> 04:23.872
It's because there's a witch.

04:24.247 --> 04:27.017
Back in the Witch's Play incident,

04:27.017 --> 04:29.144
the Paladin Corps weren't called,

04:29.144 --> 04:31.797
so the situation got that dire.

04:32.172 --> 04:35.217
The citizens also didn't
think they were in danger.

04:35.759 --> 04:39.012
This is what actually should be happening
during a witch-related incident.

04:40.013 --> 04:41.823
With a witch's power,

04:41.973 --> 04:45.143
you can easily blow away
a town or two, after all.

04:46.728 --> 04:47.604
Wait.

04:48.021 --> 04:49.648
The area ahead is sealed off right now.

04:50.107 --> 04:52.984
Also, you're quite underdressed.

04:53.360 --> 04:55.237
We came from out of town.

04:55.612 --> 04:57.239
It's still only
the start of autumn, right?

04:57.656 --> 05:00.534
I wanted to ask why it's this cold.

05:01.201 --> 05:02.619
There's a witch.

05:02.911 --> 05:05.122
Anything's possible when they're around.

05:05.664 --> 05:08.500
Any and all disasters
are a witch's doing, huh?

05:08.750 --> 05:09.626
What?

05:09.876 --> 05:11.211
No, it's nothing.

05:12.129 --> 05:13.839
But this is a problem.

05:14.047 --> 05:16.383
My grandmother lives alone.

05:16.675 --> 05:20.512
I couldn't reach her,
so I wanted to check if she's alright.

05:21.638 --> 05:24.533
If that's the case,
I'd love to let you in,

05:24.850 --> 05:28.270
but I was told to not
let just anyone in here.

05:28.812 --> 05:30.647
I figured as much.

05:31.565 --> 05:34.818
Then, can you show me your ID
and the contents of that coffin?

05:35.318 --> 05:36.962
Will a brand work?

05:37.195 --> 05:38.613
Yeah, show me.

05:43.802 --> 05:45.554
I thought so. You're a spellcaster.

05:45.787 --> 05:47.956
Seems like you were from here.

05:48.665 --> 05:50.375
Nothing particularly stands out.

05:50.917 --> 05:52.711
You just have to show me that coffin.

05:52.961 --> 05:55.464
About that, no problem.

05:58.383 --> 05:59.759
That's...

06:00.218 --> 06:03.263
It's the Holy Church's
seal of approval for magical tools.

06:03.763 --> 06:08.727
Having this means there's
no space in there to smuggle in anything.

06:09.019 --> 06:11.771
If the Church has issued that to you,
then I see no problem.

06:12.105 --> 06:14.105
Hey. Escort them in.

06:14.274 --> 06:15.066
Yes, sir!

06:21.698 --> 06:23.116
Are you lost?

06:23.408 --> 06:25.285
Should I lend you a map?

06:26.411 --> 06:28.121
Don't kill him, Guideau.

06:33.668 --> 06:36.046
Now, then. Let's hurry on ahead.

06:36.796 --> 06:38.673
Aren't you from here?

06:39.341 --> 06:40.967
Then you should know the way.

06:41.259 --> 06:43.512
That's fake, obviously.

06:43.970 --> 06:47.599
Working with the Order
is convenient, right?

06:47.849 --> 06:49.684
It would've been faster to beat them up.

06:49.935 --> 06:51.728
My, my.

06:52.103 --> 06:53.605
How barbaric.

06:54.689 --> 06:56.525
It's still so cold even with a coat.

06:56.858 --> 06:59.110
It's like it's going to snow.

07:11.790 --> 07:14.751
Captain Cugat, we're against a witch.

07:15.377 --> 07:18.505
Going against her alone without
bringing us officers with you...

07:18.922 --> 07:20.507
Save the chatter for later.

07:21.049 --> 07:22.676
I lost track of the witch.

07:23.176 --> 07:25.878
Captain, you went out and
acted on your own again...

07:25.879 --> 07:27.097
Save that for later.

07:27.764 --> 07:30.725
I leave it to you all to continue
searching for the witch.

07:31.810 --> 07:33.745
If you find her,

07:33.937 --> 07:37.440
prioritize trying to capture her.

07:39.568 --> 07:42.487
As for taking her down, I'll do it.

07:43.839 --> 07:45.532
What reliable words.

07:45.757 --> 07:49.469
But the mission here is only
to apprehend the witch.

07:49.744 --> 07:52.247
You must not kill her.

07:53.123 --> 07:53.984
Who is he?

07:54.332 --> 07:56.209
An envoy from the Holy Church.

07:56.835 --> 08:00.297
He had already been investigating
this witch on his own prior to this.

08:00.755 --> 08:04.009
The fact that we found out about
this incident so soon is thanks to him.

08:04.342 --> 08:06.011
Then, why is he here?

08:06.261 --> 08:08.013
To provide information, I believe.

08:08.430 --> 08:11.933
He has valuable information
on the witch, supposedly.

08:16.438 --> 08:19.691
That's the Paladin Corps' stronghold
when they're on the move.

08:20.191 --> 08:21.151
Their base.

08:22.110 --> 08:24.337
It's built with a special material,

08:24.487 --> 08:26.948
and additionally,
it's protected by numerous barriers.

08:27.866 --> 08:30.368
Even a witch would have
a hard time destroying it.

08:30.994 --> 08:36.041
And the barrier surrounding this town
is equally hard to break.

08:36.416 --> 08:40.253
Even if you destroy it, the Paladins
would detect it and rush here.

08:40.395 --> 08:44.424
Then how do we get in?

08:44.674 --> 08:47.510
We open a hole without them noticing.

08:48.053 --> 08:51.556
And that's a skill
I happen to be excellent at.

08:52.015 --> 08:54.893
I'm better at breaking spells
than witches are.

08:55.393 --> 08:58.496
You've partnered up
with a good organization.

08:58.730 --> 09:00.915
Stop the yapping and do it already.

09:00.915 --> 09:03.460
Doing this takes time, you know.

09:08.907 --> 09:09.991
What the...

09:19.250 --> 09:20.418
It's a witch.

09:21.795 --> 09:23.838
Ashaf, hurry and open this up!

09:23.838 --> 09:25.565
Don't rush me so much.

09:25.965 --> 09:27.467
It's already open.

09:32.514 --> 09:35.392
Geez. What's in the world is happening?

09:39.162 --> 09:41.080
I don't want to die yet.

09:41.773 --> 09:43.525
I won't die.

09:44.234 --> 09:47.070
I haven't even had a boyfriend yet!

10:00.959 --> 10:02.811
These ones also got defeated.

10:03.336 --> 10:06.756
Reporting! Seeker eliminated
in a fight with the witch!

10:07.132 --> 10:09.300
Now our scouting squad
has all been wiped out.

10:09.718 --> 10:11.261
Prepare the second wave.

10:11.636 --> 10:13.638
According to the information
from the first wave,

10:13.864 --> 10:17.058
The witch materializes swords
and freely controls them.

10:17.684 --> 10:19.728
Her height is about 170 centimeters.

10:20.103 --> 10:21.521
Long black hair.

10:21.938 --> 10:24.774
We've confirmed she has
ultoma around her right eye.

10:25.316 --> 10:26.835
This information isn't en...

10:26.835 --> 10:28.778
It's 168.

10:29.070 --> 10:30.071
What is?

10:30.405 --> 10:31.740
Her height.

10:32.157 --> 10:35.660
Her hair color is actually
black with a tinge of red.

10:35.994 --> 10:38.705
She likes monotone clothing, you see.

10:39.247 --> 10:43.084
In particular, she always carries
a black tube-like leather bag.

10:43.376 --> 10:44.878
Other than that...

10:45.086 --> 10:47.630
You're particularly
knowledgeable about her, I see.

10:48.965 --> 10:53.303
In that case, you must know
which witch she descended from, correct?

10:53.678 --> 10:56.347
That information is
more important than anything.

10:56.723 --> 11:01.019
If we know her lineage,
we also know what powers she inherited.

11:03.062 --> 11:04.898
That is our pursuit squad.

11:05.106 --> 11:07.106
Report! Seeker eliminated!

11:07.275 --> 11:08.526
Cause undetermined!

11:08.818 --> 11:11.404
The pursuit squad is
supposed to be undercover.

11:11.946 --> 11:13.072
What happened?

11:13.364 --> 11:16.910
They were supposedly tracking her
from outside of her attack range,

11:17.160 --> 11:19.662
but without any tactical signs,

11:20.288 --> 11:22.916
they all suddenly got
attacked by her in their blind spots.

11:29.631 --> 11:31.274
What is it this time?!

11:31.591 --> 11:32.842
Good grief.

11:33.343 --> 11:35.845
Keep buying time, Guideau.

11:36.095 --> 11:38.072
I found you, rotten witch!

11:38.348 --> 11:39.574
Take a good look.

11:39.849 --> 11:42.243
Does this face look familiar to you?!

11:42.435 --> 11:45.288
A woman with a face
of pure evil like yours...

11:45.647 --> 11:46.940
...wouldn't be familiar to me, obviously!

11:57.325 --> 11:58.076
I won't let you go!

12:22.475 --> 12:23.935
Good work, Guideau.

12:24.435 --> 12:28.164
It was quite the long spell,
but I'm glad I pulled it off in time.

12:36.406 --> 12:37.657
It's compression magic.

12:38.032 --> 12:39.409
I didn't ask.

12:39.951 --> 12:44.875
I know she's not my witch because
she got cornered so easily, but..

12:45.039 --> 12:46.374
She's way too weak.

12:46.708 --> 12:48.209
You're sure she's not a fake?

12:48.501 --> 12:51.296
No, she's definitely a witch.

12:52.005 --> 12:53.381
Something's up with her.

12:53.840 --> 12:56.384
It makes her unable to
unleash her witch powers.

12:57.051 --> 13:01.556
If not for that, a witch won't just
let herself be cornered like that.

13:01.823 --> 13:05.268
Huh? Why do you know that?

13:05.810 --> 13:07.395
Because I know.

13:07.812 --> 13:12.108
I know what kind of witch she is
based on her ultoma.

13:16.237 --> 13:20.325
She's actually the weakest witch
among the ones I know.

13:20.909 --> 13:22.577
But even so, she's still a witch.

13:22.994 --> 13:26.706
Sometimes they do tend
to defy your expectations.

13:27.373 --> 13:30.281
Had you not been
keeping information from us,

13:30.282 --> 13:32.712
our expectations would be
more on the mark.

13:33.212 --> 13:37.258
Hmph. I know that I'm not welcomed here.

13:37.592 --> 13:42.096
I was worried that you'd
cast me out if I reveal everything.

13:42.722 --> 13:44.390
But, sure.

13:46.309 --> 13:49.687
Materializing weapons
and controlling them...

13:50.188 --> 13:52.857
You can do that
even if you're not a witch.

13:53.566 --> 13:56.611
But the ultoma, the mark of a witch...

13:56.611 --> 14:01.074
Only one person has it
in the shape of swords.

14:01.866 --> 14:02.992
It can't be...

14:06.120 --> 14:07.789
She is an Origin.

14:08.539 --> 14:10.041
The Dauntless Witch.

14:10.375 --> 14:12.669
Descendant of Quena Velvette...

14:13.962 --> 14:15.672
Helga Velvette.

14:16.839 --> 14:22.303
Those in her lineage are extremely weak
in battle, for a certain reason.

14:22.595 --> 14:25.223
But if you're not careful...

14:28.226 --> 14:30.203
This might sound strange,

14:30.687 --> 14:32.580
but it's true that she's the weakest.

14:32.855 --> 14:37.193
But at the same time,
she has the means to destroy the world.

14:38.569 --> 14:40.671
Come on, now,
you've got to be kidding me...

14:41.030 --> 14:42.840
Did she take one with her?

14:46.494 --> 14:47.620
A demon sword?

14:50.182 --> 14:51.241
That's right.

14:51.666 --> 14:56.212
The truly dangerous part of
this incident is not the witch.

14:57.380 --> 15:00.591
Its wielder will have power
that can rule the world,

15:00.883 --> 15:03.469
bringing destruction to everything else.

15:03.720 --> 15:05.555
Demon sword, Ashgan.

15:06.222 --> 15:08.933
Most likely, she has it with her.

15:10.059 --> 15:12.603
Deploy as many squads as possible!

15:12.979 --> 15:16.816
If the witch has a demon sword,
then we don't have a second to waste.

15:17.150 --> 15:18.568
We'll take her down at full force!

15:18.568 --> 15:19.527
Yes, sir!

15:20.445 --> 15:21.320
Farmus.

15:21.738 --> 15:24.490
Stay here and command the seeker squads.

15:24.490 --> 15:25.283
Yes, sir.

15:25.533 --> 15:27.176
And one more thing.

15:27.660 --> 15:29.454
Monitoring him?

15:29.996 --> 15:33.015
He's not trying to hide
how suspicious he is.

15:33.015 --> 15:36.335
I feel like it's not because
he knows he's innocent.

15:36.919 --> 15:38.838
And he's also a spellcaster.

15:39.172 --> 15:40.590
Be very cautious.

15:48.890 --> 15:51.143
Ugh, what a pain.

15:51.809 --> 15:54.812
Just using compression magic
to capture her would be tough.

15:55.271 --> 15:59.167
Compressing her alone
already required so much energy.

15:59.400 --> 16:02.278
I didn't think she'd have a demon sword.

16:02.570 --> 16:04.130
It got way too dense in there.

16:04.614 --> 16:06.866
That's why the compression got broken.

16:07.200 --> 16:09.368
What the hell is a "demon sword"?

16:09.477 --> 16:11.621
Is it that big of a deal?

16:11.871 --> 16:15.208
It's the biggest deal of all.

16:15.458 --> 16:18.544
As long as it's undrawn,
a demon sword is nothing particular.

16:18.920 --> 16:22.340
But once it's drawn from its scabbard,

16:22.590 --> 16:24.425
no one can control it.

16:24.842 --> 16:26.636
Not even a witch.

16:26.803 --> 16:29.055
So you mean it's hella strong?

16:29.263 --> 16:30.907
That's right.

16:31.432 --> 16:32.642
Stronger than me?

16:33.076 --> 16:34.135
I wonder about that.

16:34.852 --> 16:38.231
But which one's stronger,
you or a demon sword...

16:38.564 --> 16:39.732
That intrigues me.

16:40.958 --> 16:41.776
Watch out.

16:46.572 --> 16:47.782
Found you.

16:48.407 --> 16:52.078
Can you just do something
about those awful crows first?

16:53.788 --> 16:56.624
I want to talk to you about something.
Don't attack us anymore.

16:56.833 --> 16:59.752
Huh? You want to talk to me
after all that?

17:00.294 --> 17:02.271
If you want to have a friendly chat,

17:02.505 --> 17:04.505
then do it before you attack me!

17:04.674 --> 17:06.843
I'm sorry about that.

17:07.385 --> 17:10.012
I didn't want to do it,
but I had no choice.

17:10.637 --> 17:12.306
How do I put it...

17:12.640 --> 17:15.159
We clearly look suspicious, right?

17:15.159 --> 17:16.102
Yeah.

17:16.102 --> 17:21.208
In that situation,
would you even just hear us out like that?

17:21.208 --> 17:21.983
Nope.

17:22.316 --> 17:24.609
That's how it is, see.

17:25.236 --> 17:28.030
We want to protect you at a safer place.

17:28.364 --> 17:29.173
Protect?

17:29.173 --> 17:30.741
Yes, protect.

17:31.033 --> 17:32.118
I swear to you.

17:32.618 --> 17:34.787
We are not your enemies.

17:35.288 --> 17:39.125
We're here to help you run away
from the Paladin Corps.

17:45.882 --> 17:47.175
Interesting.

17:47.800 --> 17:51.070
Helga, don't be so cruel to them.

17:51.070 --> 17:52.030
Hey!

17:52.030 --> 17:53.931
Do you have to suspect them?

17:54.348 --> 17:56.976
Aren't you in a desperate situation?

17:57.393 --> 18:00.950
- In that case, it doesn't matter...
- Ugh, don't speak!

18:01.230 --> 18:02.623
I'm surprised.

18:02.791 --> 18:04.960
That demon sword can speak?

18:05.359 --> 18:06.794
Why are you surprised?

18:07.153 --> 18:09.880
Swords speak. That's to be expected.

18:09.880 --> 18:12.758
Ashgan! Don't say anything!

18:12.758 --> 18:15.411
Just be quiet, like I always tell you to.

18:15.703 --> 18:17.788
- The fact that swords speak...
- Shut up!

18:18.289 --> 18:19.790
I have a question.

18:20.208 --> 18:24.003
Demon swords are supposed to
be protected by your Dauntless clan,

18:24.295 --> 18:27.632
at a secret place nobody knows about.

18:28.466 --> 18:30.593
Taking it outside would be dangerous.

18:30.968 --> 18:32.887
What are the circumstances
that made you do it?

18:33.262 --> 18:35.014
It's none of your business.

18:35.681 --> 18:39.227
Right now, I won't trust anyone.

18:39.518 --> 18:41.979
Then, you should eliminate us right now.

18:42.271 --> 18:43.272
Why aren't you doing it?

18:44.232 --> 18:46.459
If you're doubting us,

18:46.459 --> 18:49.153
that means you only see us as your enemy.

18:51.280 --> 18:52.615
This witch incident...

18:53.157 --> 18:55.368
It started with a murder
committed by a witch.

18:55.660 --> 18:57.261
Six victims.

18:57.846 --> 19:01.791
If you're the one who did that,
then why are you hesitating?

19:02.558 --> 19:03.584
Don't come closer!

19:05.795 --> 19:10.716
Seems like you don't have the kind of
cruel heart to murder helpless humans.

19:11.634 --> 19:13.552
You didn't do it, right?

19:15.012 --> 19:18.182
Then all the more reason
for us to help you.

19:19.350 --> 19:20.476
What's the price?

19:21.435 --> 19:22.728
What do you want from us?

19:23.312 --> 19:24.939
I'm sure it's not free.

19:26.232 --> 19:27.942
This woman's life?

19:28.693 --> 19:31.070
Fine by me. You can take it.

19:31.404 --> 19:33.364
Don't just decide things!

19:33.698 --> 19:36.492
It doesn't matter what their goal is.

19:37.326 --> 19:38.411
Take their offer.

19:39.495 --> 19:41.455
It's more fun that way.

19:49.297 --> 19:51.882
Phew. Way to spoil the mood.

19:52.258 --> 19:53.634
The second wave is here.

19:53.884 --> 19:55.903
What are those guys?

19:55.903 --> 19:58.931
They're like alter egos for the Paladins.

19:59.473 --> 20:02.643
Destroying them doesn't
affect their main bodies.

20:03.227 --> 20:08.524
They'll just recharge their energy from
the tank at their base and come back.

20:08.858 --> 20:12.862
So they can continually
send immortal soldiers?

20:13.112 --> 20:18.075
Yes, that's the Paladin Corps'
main strategy for a witch hunt.

20:19.201 --> 20:22.972
Two layers should be
enough for seekers' fire.

20:31.088 --> 20:32.131
Over here, quick!

20:35.110 --> 20:36.282
Take that hand.

20:37.053 --> 20:38.179
Go with him.

20:39.305 --> 20:41.098
You can't survive alone.

20:45.936 --> 20:49.190
Unfortunately, I have to remain alone.

20:50.107 --> 20:52.026
I don't need your help.

20:53.402 --> 20:54.653
But, I should say...

20:57.698 --> 20:58.616
Thank you.

21:00.618 --> 21:03.162
Hmm. We got rejected.

21:03.329 --> 21:04.997
Ha! You had it coming.

21:05.164 --> 21:07.666
Why are you saying it
like it's not your problem?

21:08.084 --> 21:09.502
You have to go after her.

21:10.336 --> 21:12.463
Guideau, you understand, right?

21:12.755 --> 21:13.631
Huh?

21:13.923 --> 21:16.634
She's not the witch you're after.

21:16.926 --> 21:21.222
That means, we have to focus on our
actual duty, which is to take her with us.

21:21.806 --> 21:23.891
Do everything you can to protect her.

21:24.475 --> 21:27.311
I'll do what I have to do
even without you telling me.

21:38.406 --> 21:40.908
What a stubborn woman.

21:41.617 --> 21:42.993
But, it's admirable.

21:43.410 --> 21:46.789
